   resolves in the SVG's own coordinate space, exactly like the stroke-width
   attribute in the exported file. The Customizer's control is in pixels and JS
   converts it once (src/utils/iconStroke.js, strokeAttrForPx) for both the Stage
   and the export, so the preview cannot disagree with the download. The literal
   2 below is the pre-paint fallback and equals the 4px default at size 48. ══ */
.icust-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9998;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding:max(6vh,48px) 16px 32px;background:var(--scrim);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);overflow:hidden;animation:cp-fade var(--dur-1) var(--ease-entrance)}
